            <creation xml:id="creation_346N20124">
               <date enddate="1846-11-26" startdate="1846-07-29" xml:id="date_795e9ac3">29 July to 26 Nov. 1846</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_346N20122">
               <p xml:id="idm114">Hartmann sat music to some of Ingemann's poems in 1845, and the following year the author sent him his "Blandede Digte", which had been published that year. Hartmann composed music to six of them. Some of the songs are strophic and others through composed.</p>
            </history>
